---
description: Gate scaffolding through AI Development Kit project readiness and kit gap analysis
alwaysApply: true
---

Recognize `check project readiness`.

Before new-project scaffolding:
- derive required capabilities from canonical docs
- verify actual kit scaffold/template/generator/validator support
- write `.ai-kit/project-readiness.json`
- block scaffold on MISSING/PARTIAL/CONFLICT
- prefer reusable kit capability fixes over project-specific workarounds

If READY, use compatible preset composition.
